# Agent routing

**Live tickets:** Jira/Linear via MCP when configured — do not recreate per-ticket files in the repo.

| Need | Where |
|------|--------|
| Symptom → skill or doc | `.cursor/context/ROUTING.md` |
| Project stack and run locally | `.cursor/context/PROJECT.md` |
| Episodic memory | `node .cursor/tools/cli/memory.mjs bootstrap` · skill `memory-bank` |
| Ticket WIP / attachments | `.cursor/temp/<issue-key>/` |
| Credentials | `.cursor/secrets/` — never @-attach in chat |
| New reusable CLI | `.cursor/tools/` · `proj-tools-layout.mdc` |

## Triggers

| User / situation | Follow |
|------------------|--------|
| First message in any chat | `memory.mjs bootstrap` (`proj-memory-bank.mdc`) |
| Start of workday | skill `session-start` · `proj-daily-day-plan.mdc` |
| What's next / new work | skill `sprint-pickup` |
| Pick up ticket | skill `jira-get-context` |
| Before push / PR | `proj-no-pr-without-verification.mdc` · skill `pr-prepare` |
| Open PR | skill `pr-create` · `proj-pr-create-assignees.mdc` |
| Jira update | `proj-jira-reports.mdc` — draft first, post after user confirms |
| Ticket done | `temp-cleanup.mjs` · episodic `log` if verified |

Always-on gates: `proj-minimal-changes.mdc`, `proj-no-invention.mdc`, `proj-verify-before-infer.mdc`, `proj-secrets-handling.mdc`, `proj-tools-not-temp.mdc`.
